Package: AI4BayesCode
Title: Stateful Modular MCMC Building Blocks with AI-Friendly Skill Chain
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-07-02
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jungang", "Zou",
           email = "jungang.zou@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("AI4BayesCode contributors", role = "ctb"))
Description: Header-only C++ library for stateful, modular MCMC samplers
    that compose NUTS, joint NUTS, BART, Gibbs, RJMCMC, HMM, slice sampling,
    and variational inference blocks within a single Gibbs loop. Generated
    samplers expose one uniform interface: step, get_current, set_current,
    predict_at, get_dag, get_history, and readapt_NUTS for sequential and
    online-learning workflows. Every generated sampler is compiled, run, and
    checked for convergence and posterior-predictive fit before it is
    delivered. Bundles the runtime, 42 reference examples, and the skill
    corpus, plus natural-language-to-code generation via
    'ai4bayescode_generate()'.
